WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:04.390
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and this week
agents of shield finally revealed what real

00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:07.020
life simmons has been up to and we got to
spend some more time learning about the big

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:08.510
villain Doctor Whitehall aka Kraken.

00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:12.080
The interesting thing is that even though
they had a super powered comic book character

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.170
in the episode.

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:16.250
He wasn’t really the biggest thing in the
episode and I really like that they did that.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:18.119
They made Simmons the main character.

00:00:18.119 --> 00:00:25.550
Lot’s of big stuff this week so few announcements
at the end but careful for spoilers from the

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:27.400
episode if you haven’t seen it yet.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.990
I’ll wait just a sec...okay, top 5 moments.

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:33.660
Number 5 - Kraken Is Stealing SHIELD Agents

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:39.329
Did anyone else catch the reference to Sound
of Music, it was the “Very Good Place to

00:00:39.329 --> 00:00:40.329
Start” line.

00:00:40.329 --> 00:00:41.960
It’s the Do-Re-Mi Song.

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:42.960
Very sinister.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:49.769
Of course that story took place in Nazi Germany
and Kraken was a Nazi so it’s totally appropriate.

00:00:49.769 --> 00:01:03.559
It gives the whole rest of the episode this
Sound of Music theme where Clark Gregg is

00:01:03.559 --> 00:01:07.200
the Christopher Plummer character, Captain
Von Trapp and he’s trying to keep his family

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.390
safe from the Nazis.

00:01:08.390 --> 00:01:12.690
I guess that would make May the Julie Andrews
Maria character.

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.110
They did dress Skye up kind of like a Nun
with her black hood here.

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:20.480
It’s just a fun meta way to look at the
episode, Music was a big part of the episode

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:23.340
too and Sound of Music was a Musical.

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:42.440
Kraken bookened the episode, so we’ll see
more of him in the future.

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:50.500
But aside from the Sound of Music moment,
my favorite part was the big oh shit at the

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:54.170
end when they implied they might try to brainwash
Simmons.

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:57.680
Number 4 - Donnie Gill aka Blizzard is Back

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:00.920
I love that they had some more fun with the
powers in the episode and that they kind of

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:02.540
buried the lead a little.

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:09.390
He wasn’t the biggest part of the episode,
so I’m glad we didn’t spend more time

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:11.210
than was necessary with him.

00:02:11.210 --> 00:02:16.500
Yes powers are cool, but this was all about
Simmons, so Blizzard was just in here as a

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:19.100
way to explain how HYDRA’s conditioning
works.

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:23.500
That also explains last week’s episode where
Absorbing Man got all creepy.

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:26.800
Compliance will be rewarded.

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:33.730
Turned out Donnie had been brainwashed the
whole time and HYDRA just reactivated him.

00:02:33.730 --> 00:02:37.700
And the fact they didn’t find the body at
the end of the episode just means that he’s

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:39.890
still out there in the world alive.

00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:44.110
They didn’t kill him off, that was what
the whole Skye, crossing someone off bit was

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:45.110
at the end.

00:02:45.110 --> 00:02:46.710
Number 3 - Skye Is Trying To Keep It Together

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:52.020
It’s really all about whether or not she
has it in her to “Cross Someone Off”,

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:55.180
they kept repeating that theme.

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:58.180
I thought the watch they made her wear, the
one that tracked her pulse, was unecessary.

00:02:58.180 --> 00:03:01.420
It was just May explaining that her pulse
was a good way to measure whether or not Skye

00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:03.490
was keeping herself under control.

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:06.800
Like when Ward told her about her dad and
the watch had a heart attack.

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:10.160
She lost it for a sec and then calmed herself
down.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:14.230
She’s just trying to become a really good
agent like May, which requires control.

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:17.370
Or Compliance I guess, depending on which
team you’re playing for.

00:03:17.370 --> 00:03:24.680
I love the way Team HYDRA and Team Coulson’s
story arcs are mirroring each other.

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:29.620
Like Kraken is an evil version of Coulson.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:31.500
Number 2 - Fitz almost kills Ward

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:36.360
Loved Fitz in the episode, did not love Ward.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:38.460
And I think that’s how the writers want
us to feel.

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:42.660
Fitz hasn’t really had a confrontation with
Ward since the finale last year, so this was

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:44.480
a long time coming.

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:52.620
I know a lot of you have theories about Fitz
maybe turning evil this season.

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:56.170
I think the bit with Coulson at the end provides
some more context.

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:58.220
Coulson has the Dad moment where he explains,
yes.

00:03:58.220 --> 00:03:59.500
I am keeping things from you.

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:03.210
I’m your dad, I’m trying to protect you
and deal with a ton of other unrelated bullshit

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:04.210
in the world.

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:06.000
But you are an important part of this team.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:09.040
I felt like he was going to give Fitz a hug
for a sec.

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:14.989
I think Fitz will still be stuck like this
for most of the first half of the season.

00:04:14.989 --> 00:04:17.199
Something really significant has to happen
with his character though.

00:04:17.199 --> 00:04:22.059
I just keep wondering if it’s going to have
something to do with the HYDRA plot or Skye’s

00:04:22.059 --> 00:04:23.919
Father and the Obelisk.

00:04:23.919 --> 00:04:25.319
Characters have to change.

00:04:25.319 --> 00:04:28.550
Matter only has two states of existence, Growth
and Decay.

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:33.240
So either Fitz has to keep getting worse or
he has to evolve somehow.

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:35.379
Evolve doesn’t necessarily mean something
good.

00:04:35.379 --> 00:04:39.090
He could get wrapped up in the Simmons HYDRA
plot.

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:43.629
and my Number 1 Moment - Simmons is HYDRA

00:04:43.629 --> 00:04:45.850
She was by far, the best part of the episode.

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:53.190
They could have just done the Simmons scenes
and it still would have been an amazing episode.

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:56.029
The name of that song that she woke up to
is God Help the Girl.

00:04:56.029 --> 00:04:59.360
Which is funny, because Coulson brought food,
helping the girl.

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:01.740
Thus Coulson is God.

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:06.610
He is kind of Immortal inside the Marvel Universe,
so you could say he’s like a God.

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:10.059
It seems like based on that last little bit
in the episode, Simmons will stay inside HYDRA

00:05:10.059 --> 00:05:17.219
for most of the season, or at least until
Kraken learns she’s a double agent.

00:05:17.219 --> 00:05:18.750
And that will definitely happen.

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:22.099
I wouldn’t be surprised if they did something
like that during the mid-season finale.

00:05:22.099 --> 00:05:29.040
So just look forward to learning more about
Kraken when we get our Simmons scenes.

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:33.580
Because they’re literally moving her upstairs,
she’ll be working directly with Kraken and

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:34.580
this guy.

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:39.120
It’s like Simmons is getting promoted to
work inside one of these crazy Baron Von Strucker

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:40.120
labs.

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:47.259
His operation is way more advanced than normal
HYDRA.

00:05:47.259 --> 00:05:53.740
It’s like the way Red Skull said HYDRA was
way beyond the Nazi’s in terms of scope.

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:57.889
Baron Von Strucker and Kraken are way beyond
the scope of HYDRA.

00:05:57.889 --> 00:06:05.300
Just pushing the boundaries of science.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:08.199
Let me know what your favorite part of the
episode was, and what do you think they’re

00:06:08.199 --> 00:07:07.460
going to have Simmons doing in that upstairs
lab?

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:11.800
Next week they’re going full fan fiction
with Coulson and May, and I am 100 percent

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:14.969
on board with it.

00:07:14.969 --> 00:07:18.960
Because my Flash videos will always go up
first Tuesday nights, I’ll try to get SHIELD

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:21.619
videos up as early as possible on Wednesday
Mornings.

00:07:21.619 --> 00:07:23.630
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:27.380
The big news today is that Arrow Season 3
is premiering.

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:35.819
So be sure to check back after the episode
tonight.

